{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "id": "code-review-scout-fix",
  "scope": "system",
  "title": "Code Review Scout Fix",
  "description": "基于 code review 报告的保守修复管线：确定性收集 review ResourceBundle，Pi/MiniMax 先验证 finding 再做小范围修复，随后审计 Agent 写入边界、运行代码质量验证并由系统写出 runtime 内部修复报告。",
  "version": 5,
  "readonly": false,
  "metadata": {
    "tags": [
      "system",
      "code-review",
      "scout-fix",
      "pi",
      "resource-bundle",
      "code-quality",
      "write-scope-audit"
    ],
    "owner": "blackboard",
    "created_by": "codex",
    "updated_by": "codex",
    "run_policy": {
      "allow_concurrent_runs": false,
      "max_concurrent_runs": 1,
      "queue_enabled": true,
      "max_queue_wait_ms": 7200000,
      "queue_timeout_retry_enabled": true,
      "max_queue_timeout_retries": 5
    }
  },
  "inputs": [
    {
      "id": "input",
      "label": "Fix Prompt",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "请基于 code review 报告做 scout fix：先验证 finding，只默认修 critical/high/medium 的高置信、低风险、小范围问题。low/info/nit 只记录不修，除非本输入明确点名要求修。不要修误报，不要回退无关改动。",
      "description": "本次 scout fix 的任务描述。"
    },
    {
      "id": "source-root",
      "label": "Source Root",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "{{env.root}}/..",
      "description": "代码根目录。"
    },
    {
      "id": "review-report-path",
      "label": "Review Report Path",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "{{env.workspace}}/runtime/nightly/internal/reviews/code-review.md",
      "description": "rust-vue-code-review 产出的内部 Markdown 报告。"
    },
    {
      "id": "validation-timeout-seconds",
      "label": "Validation Timeout Seconds",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 900,
      "min": 60,
      "max": 3600
    },
    {
      "id": "output-slug",
      "label": "Output Slug",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "code-review-scout-fix",
      "description": "内部 Markdown 文件名，写入 runtime/nightly/internal/reviews/{output-slug}.md。"
    }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "start",
      "type": "start",
      "label": "Start",
      "position": {
        "x": 40,
        "y": 220
      },
      "config": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "collect-fix-context",
      "type": "shell",
      "label": "Collect Fix ResourceBundle",
      "description": "确定性读取 review 报告、抽取 finding、收集 git 状态，stdout_json 即 ResourceBundle。",
      "position": {
        "x": 390,
        "y": 220
      },
      "config": {
        "command": "python",
        "args": [
          "{{env.scripts_dir}}/collect_code_review_fix_resource_bundle.py",
          "--repo-root",
          "{{env.root}}/..",
          "--source-root",
          "{{inputs.source-root}}",
          "--review-report-path",
          "{{inputs.review-report-path}}",
          "--fix-input",
          "{{inputs.input}}",
          "--max-report-chars",
          "50000",
          "--max-findings",
          "20"
        ],
        "permission": "read_only",
        "expected_exit_codes": [
          0
        ],
        "timeout_ms": 300000,
        "capture": {
          "max_bytes": 1048576,
          "strip_ansi": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scout-fix",
      "type": "llm",
      "label": "Pi Scout Fix",
      "description": "Pi LLM 节点：把 review finding 当成线索，验证后只做高置信小修复，并输出 Markdown 修复报告。",
      "position": {
        "x": 760,
        "y": 220
      },
      "config": {
        "runtime": "pi",
        "agent": "native",
        "model": "minimax-cn/MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed",
        "skills": [
          "code-review-scout-fix"
        ],
        "inputs": {
          "resource_bundle": "{{nodes.collect-fix-context.output.stdout_json}}"
        },
        "output": {
          "artifact_type": "markdown",
          "required": true
        },
        "retry": {
          "enabled": true,
          "max_attempts": 2,
          "backoff_ms": 2000
        },
        "prompt": {
          "mode": "inline",
          "template": "你是 Blackboard code-review-scout-fix 增强 LLM 节点。\n\n你必须使用 code-review-scout-fix skill。\n\n核心规则：\n1. review 报告只是线索，不是事实。每个 finding 必须先读源码验证。\n2. 默认只允许修 critical/high/medium 严重度的高置信、低风险、小范围问题；最多 3 个小修复。\n3. low/info/nit/residual-risk-only 只写入 skipped，不要修改代码，除非 inputs.input 明确点名要求修这个具体问题。\n4. 只允许编辑源码/脚本：bb_backend/**、bb_web/**、bb_desktop/**、scripts/**。\n5. 严禁创建或编辑仓库治理/配置文件，例如 .gitattributes、.gitignore、.editorconfig、.prettierrc*、.eslintrc*、.github/**。\n6. 严禁写入或编辑任何 .bb_template/** 文件，尤其是 .bb_template/task_graphs/**、.bb_template/skills/**、.bb_template/projects/**、.bb_template/wiki/**、.bb_template/runtime/**。\n7. 严禁使用 write 工具生成报告。修复报告只能作为本次回答的 Markdown 文本返回，由 system_write_output 节点写入 runtime 内部目录，不写入 wiki。\n8. 不要回退或清理无关 dirty work；如果发现并发改动冲突，跳过并说明。\n9. 如果 finding 是误报、过期、太宽泛、样式/换行类问题或需要产品判断，写入 skipped。\n\nResourceBundle JSON：\n{{inputs.resource_bundle}}\n\n请执行 scout fix。最后只返回中文 Markdown 报告，不要把报告写到任何文件。"
        },
        "tool_policy": {
          "allowed_tools": [
            "read",
            "grep",
            "find",
            "ls",
            "edit"
          ],
          "write_roots": [
            "{{env.root}}/../bb_backend",
            "{{env.root}}/../bb_web",
            "{{env.root}}/../bb_desktop",
            "{{env.root}}/../scripts"
          ]
        },
        "resource_bundle": {
          "input": "resource_bundle",
          "required": true
        },
        "output_contract": {
          "artifact_type": "markdown",
          "required": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "audit-write-scope",
      "type": "shell",
      "label": "Audit Agent Write Scope",
      "description": "确定性审计 scout-fix agent session 的 edit/write 工具调用，确保未写入 graph、skill、project data、runtime 或其他禁止路径。",
      "position": {
        "x": 1130,
        "y": 220
      },
      "config": {
        "command": "python",
        "args": [
          "{{env.scripts_dir}}/task_graph_agent_write_scope_audit.py",
          "--workspace-root",
          "{{env.workspace}}",
          "--project",
          "blackboard",
          "--graph-id",
          "code-review-scout-fix",
          "--rule",
          "scout-fix::bb_backend,bb_web,bb_desktop,scripts::.bb_template,.git,target,node_modules,bb_web/dist"
        ],
        "permission": "read_only",
        "expected_exit_codes": [
          0
        ],
        "timeout_ms": 300000,
        "capture": {
          "max_bytes": 1048576,
          "strip_ansi": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verify-after-fix",
      "type": "shell",
      "label": "Code Quality Verify",
      "description": "运行现有代码质量验证脚本，输出 stdout_json。脚本始终 exit 0，用 has_issues 表达质量检查结果。",
      "position": {
        "x": 1500,
        "y": 220
      },
      "config": {
        "command": "python",
        "args": [
          "{{env.scripts_dir}}/task_graph_code_monitor_verify.py",
          "--repo-root",
          "{{env.root}}/..",
          "--frontend-workspace",
          "bb_web",
          "--rust-workspace",
          "bb_backend",
          "--timeout-seconds",
          "{{inputs.validation-timeout-seconds}}"
        ],
        "permission": "project_write",
        "expected_exit_codes": [
          0
        ],
        "timeout_ms": 2400000,
        "capture": {
          "max_bytes": 1048576,
          "strip_ansi": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "system-write-output",
      "type": "system_write_output",
      "label": "System Write Fix Report",
      "description": "把 scout fix 报告、写域审计和 deterministic validation 摘要写入 runtime 内部目录。",
      "position": {
        "x": 1870,
        "y": 220
      },
      "config": {
        "inputs": {
          "fix_report": "{{data.scout-fix.output}}",
          "write_scope_audit": "{{nodes.audit-write-scope.output.stdout_json}}",
          "validation": "{{nodes.verify-after-fix.output.stdout_json}}"
        },
        "output_path": "{{env.workspace}}/runtime/nightly/internal/reviews/{{inputs.output-slug}}.md",
        "content": "{{inputs.fix_report}}\n\n---\n\n## Agent Write Scope Audit\n\n```json\n{{inputs.write_scope_audit}}\n```\n\n## Deterministic Code Quality Check\n\n```json\n{{inputs.validation}}\n```\n",
        "artifact_type": "markdown",
        "create_parent_dirs": true,
        "overwrite": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "end-success",
      "type": "end",
      "label": "Success",
      "position": {
        "x": 2210,
        "y": 220
      },
      "config": {
        "result": "succeeded"
      }
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e-start-collect",
      "from": "start",
      "to": "collect-fix-context",
      "kind": "exec",
      "from_pin": "exec_out",
      "to_pin": "exec_in"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-collect-fix",
      "from": "collect-fix-context",
      "to": "scout-fix",
      "kind": "exec",
      "from_pin": "exec_out",
      "to_pin": "exec_in"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-fix-audit",
      "from": "scout-fix",
      "to": "audit-write-scope",
      "kind": "exec",
      "from_pin": "exec_out",
      "to_pin": "exec_in"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-audit-verify",
      "from": "audit-write-scope",
      "to": "verify-after-fix",
      "kind": "exec",
      "from_pin": "exec_out",
      "to_pin": "exec_in"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-verify-write",
      "from": "verify-after-fix",
      "to": "system-write-output",
      "kind": "exec",
      "from_pin": "exec_out",
      "to_pin": "exec_in"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-fix-write-data",
      "from": "scout-fix",
      "to": "system-write-output",
      "kind": "data",
      "from_pin": "output",
      "to_pin": "content"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-write-end",
      "from": "system-write-output",
      "to": "end-success",
      "kind": "exec",
      "from_pin": "exec_out",
      "to_pin": "exec_in"
    }
  ],
  "layout": {
    "viewport": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "scale": 1
    }
  }
}
